Unify interfaces with a shared trait, allowing a single generic function to handle both classes.
```rust
trait Query {
    fn is_active(&self) -> bool;
    fn execute(&self);
}

fn process_query<Q: Query>(q: &Q) {
    if q.is_active() {
        q.execute();
    }
}
